  /// CopiedOnTicket · text on the page
  /// shown through SectionLabel.text
  text "Copied" => "النسخ";
  /// CopiedOnTicket · text on the page
  text "Nobody else was sent its replies." => "لم يُرسل ردّها إلى أي شخص آخر.";
  /// CopiedOnTicket · text on the page
  text "Only the customer is sent its replies." => "العميل وحده يتلقى ردودها.";

