  // ── KeptBody ──
  /// KeptBody · text on the page
  /// shown through KeptBody()
  text "A legal hold keeps it as long as the hold stands. When the hold is lifted it is kept for the rest of its period, then erased." => "يحفظها التجميد القانوني ما دام قائمًا. وعند رفعه تُحفظ بقية مدتها، ثم تُمحى.";
  /// KeptBody · text on the page
  /// shown through KeptBody()
  text "It is erased when its period ends." => "تُمحى عند انتهاء مدتها.";
  /// KeptBody · text on the page
  /// placeholders: {next} = next (string)
  /// shown through KeptBody()
  text "The customer asked to be erased, and this conversation concerns a claim, so it is kept — out of use. The ticket is closed and its promises stopped. Nobody reads it on the desk; it is read only for the claim, and every read is recorded. {next}" => "طلب العميل محو بياناته، وهذه المحادثة تخص مطالبة، لذا تُحفظ خارج الاستخدام. التذكرة مغلقة وتوقفت وعودها. لا يقرؤها أحد في المكتب؛ تُقرأ لأجل المطالبة فقط، وتُسجَّل كل قراءة. {next}";
  /// KeptBody · text on the page
  /// shown through KeptBody()
  text "The customer asked us to stop using their data until they say otherwise. Nothing is erased, and nothing is read. The ticket is closed; if they write to us again, that opens a new one." => "طلب العميل منا التوقف عن استخدام بياناته حتى يقول غير ذلك. لا يُمحى شيء، ولا يُقرأ شيء. التذكرة مغلقة؛ وإن كتب إلينا من جديد فُتحت تذكرة جديدة.";

  // ── KeptConversation ──
  /// KeptConversation · a control's name for screen readers
  accessibleName "Kept conversation" => "محادثة محفوظة";
  /// KeptConversation · a button's label · at most ~30 characters
  /// shown through Button.label
  button "Read it for the claim" => "اقرأها لأجل المطالبة";
  /// KeptConversation · text on the page
  text "This read is recorded, with your name." => "تُسجَّل هذه القراءة باسمك.";
  /// KeptConversation · a title
  /// placeholders: {t.Number} = t.Number (int)
  /// shown through ShellSheet.title
  title "Kept conversation · #{t.Number}" => "محادثة محفوظة · #{t.Number}";

