  // ── StartPrivacyRequest ──
  /// StartPrivacyRequest · a control's name for screen readers
  accessibleName "Their data" => "بياناته";
  /// StartPrivacyRequest · a button's label · at most ~28 characters
  /// shown through Button.label
  /// beside: "Close"
  button "Open it on the Inbox" => "فتحه في صندوق الوارد";
  /// StartPrivacyRequest · a button's label · at most ~23 characters
  /// shown through Button.label
  /// beside: "Cancel"
  button "Plan the request" => "تخطيط الطلب";
  /// StartPrivacyRequest · a button's label · at most ~34 characters
  /// shown through Button.label
