  /// shown through Field.label
  /// beside: "What they ask for", "How you checked it is them", "Cancel"
  label "In your words" => "بكلماتك";
  /// StartPrivacyRequest · a label (a field, a list item, a menu entry) · at most ~24 characters
  /// shown through Dropdown.label
  /// beside: "How you checked it is them", "In your words", "Cancel"
  label "What they ask for" => "ما الذي يطلبه";
  /// StartPrivacyRequest · placeholder text inside an empty field · at most ~80 characters
  /// shown through Field.placeholder
  /// beside: "What they ask for", "How you checked it is them", "Cancel"
  placeholder "A code to the address they write from came back on 3 Oct." => "أُرسل رمز إلى العنوان الذي يراسلنا منه وعاد في 3 أكتوبر.";
  /// StartPrivacyRequest · a subtitle
  /// shown through Dialog.subtitle
  subtitle "Filed on their behalf. You will see what it would do before anything happens — a complaint is kept for legal claims, the rest erased — and it runs only once an admin approves it on the Inbox, within a month of today." => "يُقدَّم نيابةً عنه. سترى ما سيفعله الطلب قبل أن يحدث أي شيء، إذ تُحفظ الشكوى لأغراض المطالبات القانونية ويُمحى الباقي، ولا يُنفَّذ إلا بعد أن يوافق عليه أحد المسؤولين في صندوق الوارد، خلال شهر من اليوم.";
  /// StartPrivacyRequest · a subtitle
  /// placeholders: {value} = … (string)
  /// shown through Dialog.subtitle
  subtitle "The request is on the Inbox, due {value}. An admin approves the plan there; until then nothing is erased." => "الطلب في صندوق الوارد، وموعد استحقاقه {value}. يوافق أحد المسؤولين على الخطة هناك؛ وحتى ذلك الحين لا يُمحى أي شيء.";
  /// StartPrivacyRequest · a subtitle
  /// shown through Dialog.subtitle
  subtitle "within a month" => "خلال شهر";
  /// StartPrivacyRequest · text on the page
  text "The desk holds nothing about them — the request will say so." => "لا يحتفظ المكتب بأي شيء عنه، وسيذكر الطلب ذلك.";
  /// StartPrivacyRequest · a title
  /// placeholders: {name} = name (string)
  /// shown through Dialog.title
  title "A privacy request for {name}" => "طلب خصوصية باسم {name}";
  /// StartPrivacyRequest · a title
  /// shown through Dialog.title
  title "Planned — nothing has happened yet" => "تم التخطيط، ولم يحدث شيء بعد";

