  mailSubject "Your request #{t.Number} is solved — {t.Title}" => "تم حل طلبك #{t.Number}: {t.Title}";
  /// TicketSolvedMail · text in an email
  mailText "What we did" => "ما فعلناه";
  /// TicketSolvedMail · text in an email
  /// shown through EmailLayout.footer
  mailText "You get this because you asked us for help. Reply to this mail to write to the team." => "تصلك هذه الرسالة لأنك طلبت مساعدتنا. ردّ على هذه الرسالة للكتابة إلى الفريق.";
  /// TicketSolvedMail · text on the page
  /// shown through EmailNote.text
  /// beside: "Your request is solved"
  text "If anything is still not right, reply to this mail — it opens your request again." => "إذا كان هناك شيء لا يزال غير صحيح، ردّ على هذه الرسالة وسيُعاد فتح طلبك.";
  /// TicketSolvedMail · text on the page
